SOAPBOX: highest score. Unfortunately, things didn't go as planned. We had
SOAPBOX: a power outage on Saturday and five on Sunday, the longest of
SOAPBOX: which (in the midst of the pileups to the USA on 15 and 20
SOAPBOX: meters) lasted almost two and a half hours, damaging a PC and the
SOAPBOX: log file. Despite everything, the fun and the good feeling among
SOAPBOX: us prevailed, as always, and this CQWW was as enjoyable as all
SOAPBOX: the others.
